## INBOX-178a proof stop

The row-13 attached-call proof constructed an exact-final-use EAX argument
plus two unrelated named `gpr32` bindings in EAX whose real allocation-plan
intervals survive the call. The direct-call action preserved only the first
live accumulator identity. The second binding remained in EAX after the
call:

```text
test=value-use call final-use plan preserves Q2 source and unrelated Q3 occupant
expected=alias2.loc != .eax
actual=alias2.loc == .eax
result=FAIL
```

The precise frozen path is:

```text
executeAttachedCallAction
  -> executeDirectCall
  -> spillLiveCallerClobbersForCall
  -> spillCurrentAccumulator
  -> liveAccumulatorName (one lookup)
  -> spillValue (one name)
```

`spillLiveCallerClobbersForCall` iterates XMM occupants with `while`, but
invokes `spillCurrentAccumulator` only once. `bindValueLoc` updates only the
selected name. Consequently another live name sharing the EAX/RAX occupant
is neither relocated nor canonically updated before the call clobber. Giving
the two names the same virtual-register metadata does not change this code
path: the selector map retains a location per name and the one-name
rebind does not refresh the other alias. This violates frozen design row 13,
“multiple aliases of the unrelated live occupant do not duplicate the
physical preservation”: one physical preservation must update every alias,
not leave an alias in the clobbered accumulator.

This is not a fixture expectation about which spill slot is selected. The
first exploratory assertion incorrectly required the second alias to share
the first alias's `.spill64` home; that was narrowed to the semantic
requirement that it leave EAX. The second run still failed. Per INBOX-178a,
the semantic implementation was not amended and no further gate was run.
The complete proof patch was retained losslessly and all four temporary
source/test/guard changes were then removed:

```text
proof_patch=tmp/inbox178a_o2_call_final_use_proof/inbox178a_semantic_defect_proof.patch
proof_patch_sha256=eda30f1f4f6503c80176511ea03cff28a80591d04f1de765690aac08cd0a3e26
semantic_restore=git diff --exit-code 462154a1 -- calls.zig calls_tests.zig authority_policy.zig authority_policy_tests.zig
semantic_restore_result=exact
calls_tests_proof_line_count=1500/1500
```

